   "new": "<figcaption>The same F<sub>2</sub> molecule with the shared pair drawn as a dash, a single covalent bond. (Figure from <em>The Basics of General, Organic, and Biological Chemistry</em> by Ball, Hill and Scott, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0.)</figcaption>",
