   "new": "<figcaption>Hydrogen and bromine share one pair of electrons to form HBr. (Figure from <em>The Basics of General, Organic, and Biological Chemistry</em> by Ball, Hill and Scott, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0.)</figcaption>",
