   "new": "<figcaption>Two hydrogen atoms each share a pair of electrons with oxygen to form H<sub>2</sub>O. (Figure from <em>The Basics of General, Organic, and Biological Chemistry</em> by Ball, Hill and Scott, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0.)</figcaption>",
